{{Enemy Infobox|Gremlin Leader}}
'''Gremlin Leader''' is an [[Elite]] Enemy encountered exclusively in [[Act 2]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Gremlin Leader}}
Depending on the amount of enemies in battle, '''Gremlin Leader''' will use one of the following actions each turn:
==== With 0 Gremlins ====
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Rally!}} (75% chance)
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Stab}} (25% chance)

==== With 1 Gremlin ====
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Rally!}} (50% chance)*
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Stab}} (50% chance)*
:<nowiki>* </nowiki> ''If last used action was'' {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Encourage}}
or
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Rally!}} (62.5% chance)**
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Encourage}} (37.5% chance)**
:<nowiki>** </nowiki> ''If last used action was'' {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Stab}}

==== With 2 or more Gremlins ====
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Encourage}} (66% chance)
* {{Int|Gremlin Leader|Stab}} (34% chance)
'''Gremlin Leader''' cannot use any [[Intent|intent]] twice in a row. No more than 3 small [[Gremlins]] can be present at once.

